<div class="resources">
    <h3>Reference Docs</h3>
    <p>Need a deeper explanation? These pages cover the same concepts:</p>
    <ul>
        <li><a href="../docs/unit-02/index.html">Unit 2: Stats &amp; Pickups</a> — the pickup family and prefab patterns</li>
